Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(356.8,14.8)}Gourmet Glasses
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.89,0:00:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.29,0:00:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starving!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.29,0:00:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum, is our dinner ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.70,0:00:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cook it in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What all is in today's menu?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.27,0:00:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Sardine!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.27,0:00:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sardine is very healthy for your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.04,0:00:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,"All-You-Can-Eat!"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.91,0:00:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.35,0:00:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's menu is Sardine!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.52,0:00:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Sardine?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.35,0:00:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I HATE Sardine!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.89,0:00:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But love-hate relationship with food isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.72,0:00:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But...!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.56,0:00:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,An idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.93,0:00:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.93,0:00:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a deep nap. Being awake makes me hungry...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.54,0:00:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What a hopeless boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.07,0:01:01.14,GadgetCard,,0,0,0,,Gourmet Glasses!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.71,0:01:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What glasses, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.68,0:01:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The Gourmet Glasses!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.61,0:01:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wear this when you're eating and the cuisine will look like your favorite food.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.12,0:01:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But the taste will be the same as Sardine?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.46,0:01:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if the appearance changes...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.56,0:01:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think I'd pull out such a useless gadget?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.93,0:01:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That means?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.46,0:01:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The taste will change too, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.16,0:01:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna try it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.77,0:01:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, Dora-{\i1}chan{\i0}, it's dinner-time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.90,0:01:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Wash your hands properly!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.41,0:01:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks yum!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.28,0:01:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna dig in!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.52,0:01:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.92,0:01:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,More please!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.36,0:01:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum, it's your chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.16,0:01:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, Nobi-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.40,0:02:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you more and more!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.73,0:02:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.00,0:02:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This Umetate looks so tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,umetate?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.94,0:02:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}, it's Yakitate, not Hagetate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.28,0:02:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yum!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.28,0:02:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.82,0:02:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so full!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.79,0:02:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need food for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.03,0:02:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What a handy gadget!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.30,0:02:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.16,0:02:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,In 22nd century, the pilots visiting earth use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.10,0:02:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Since they'd be fed up with earth's cuisine in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.87,0:02:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.64,0:02:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.97,0:02:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.58,0:02:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing food and dessert!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.88,0:02:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What will you pull out?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.85,0:02:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Chips?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.58,0:02:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this is very tasty Dorayaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.76,0:03:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. So you perceive it as Dorayaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.93,0:03:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But what a weird Dorayaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.44,0:03:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing you enjoying your meal makes me drool too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.91,0:03:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking these.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.35,0:03:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.95,0:03:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my turn, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.39,0:03:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.26,0:03:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What a delicious looking cookies!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.23,0:03:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm having these!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.80,0:03:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.27,0:03:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.57,0:03:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.81,0:03:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.48,0:03:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's begin eating!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.25,0:04:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fish once again today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.25,0:04:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have the Gourmet Glasses with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.79,0:04:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay, I'm eating Hamburger Rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.31,0:04:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm full!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.15,0:04:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.92,0:04:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.65,0:04:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.59,0:04:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You ate it fully without leaving any.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.66,0:04:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.89,0:04:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.26,0:04:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.30,0:04:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}san{\i0}, you're so cool, I hate this too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.67,0:04:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a secret, but you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.34,0:04:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,A secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.54,0:05:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes me see my favorite food? \NI wonder if it's true?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.95,0:05:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.39,0:05:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm digging in!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.59,0:05:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Upsy-Daisy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.29,0:05:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.83,0:05:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}san{\i0}, thanks for the glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.79,0:05:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd it went?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.73,0:05:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It was very tasty! It even changed the flavor. I was little surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.73,0:05:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,With these glasses you can eat any ill-tasting food with ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.73,0:05:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes the full course more exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.41,0:05:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So Dora-{\i1}chan{\i0} lent you these glasses?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.75,0:05:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep. Wish he gave me these glasses forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.62,0:05:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That way I could eat my favorite food every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.86,0:05:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I'll lend these to you whenever you feel like having 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.70,0:05:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.70,0:05:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So you were using these. We knew it was strange!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.47,0:05:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Give 'em back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.71,0:06:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's unfair of you to keep these for yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.57,0:06:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,These are just ordinary glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.58,0:06:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup, so give me back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.71,0:06:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.61,0:06:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh ,it's you, Giko.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.41,0:06:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you up to?\N What's with those eyeglasses?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.65,0:06:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you were shopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.62,0:06:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinner ingredients?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.79,0:06:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What's for dinner today?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.36,0:06:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What a tasty-looking banana!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.76,0:06:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Banana?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.23,0:06:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Giant! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.47,0:06:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you blind or what? I'm peeling off banana.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.24,0:06:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's a carrot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.00,0:06:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts? This is banana!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.58,0:06:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Diggin' in!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.95,0:06:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.15,0:06:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're like a horse
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.45,0:06:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What an tasty looking apple!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.55,0:06:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Apple?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.85,0:06:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll fall sick if you ate it without running it down in water!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.06,0:06:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But what's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.86,0:06:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's an onion!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.70,0:07:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you saying it's an onion? What's wrong with you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.80,0:07:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's an onion!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.27,0:07:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Suneo, cut it out!\N Why do you say it's an onion?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.84,0:07:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who should quit fooling around, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.94,0:07:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.75,0:07:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you wearing these weird glasses?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.62,0:07:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So spicy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.40,0:07:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.90,0:07:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you fool my senses!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.03,0:07:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm innocent!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.67,0:07:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Shaddup!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.98,0:07:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.24,0:07:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly! Gimme the glasses!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.15,0:07:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.45,0:07:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How unreasonable of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.12,0:07:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.39,0:08:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.26,0:08:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, Dora-chan, please lend me a hand here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.87,0:08:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Nobita's glasses? What a weird design!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.64,0:08:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This is beer!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.75,0:08:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad she's making tonkatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.05,0:08:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup. I can enjoy it without those glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.42,0:08:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.79,0:08:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.26,0:08:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, how considerate of your mum to give me this exquisite beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.70,0:08:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What now? Dad's drunk by drinking tea!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.27,0:08:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him enjoy once in a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.48,0:08:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.68,0:08:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,
